&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_provedores_de_inferência_huggingface&quot;&gt;Provedores de Inferência HuggingFace&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HuggingFace não realiza inferência por conta própria — ele agrega &lt;strong&gt;fornecedores&lt;/strong&gt; terceiros (Novita, Together, DeepInfra, Cerebras, SambaNova, Fireworks, Groq…) via uma API unificada. Escolhe-se o fornecedor mais barato ou o mais rápido. Os tarifos coletados em maio de 2026 para DeepSeek V4 Pro são os seguintes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 27.2727%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 18.1818%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 18.1818%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 18.1818%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;col style=&quot;width: 18.1819%;&quot;&gt;
&lt;/colgroup&gt;
&lt;thead&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Provedor HF&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;$/M&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Preservar TODO os spans de código entre crases (&lt;code&gt;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;&lt;/code&gt;) exatamente como estão — nunca modifique o conteúdo, o espaçamento ou a posição das crases. Este texto pode ser um fragmento de uma frase maior — traduza o fragmento sem solicitar mais contexto. Apresente apenas o texto traduzido — sem explicação, sem comentário, sem introdução, sem alternativas, sem opções. Saída \$/M&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;Custo/mês&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;th class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;× minha assinatura&lt;/th&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/thead&gt;
&lt;tbody&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;Novita (o mais barato)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;\$1,67&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;\$3,38&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;$374&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;19×&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;DeepInfra&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;\$1,74&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;\$3,48&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;$389&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;tableblock halign-left valign-top&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;tableblock&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;19×&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
