Atenção Altamente Comprimida&quot; as HCA #BBDEFB {
  rectangle &quot;Compressão extrema\nm&#39; &amp;gt;&amp;gt; m → 1&quot; as ECC
  rectangle &quot;Atenção densa\nresidual&quot; as EDA
  ECC --&amp;gt; EDA

  note bottom of EDA
    Contexte global
    + connexions longue distance
  end note
