&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_introdução&quot;&gt;Introdução&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Durante o desenvolvimento do plugin Gradle&lt;strong&gt;Padaria&lt;/strong&gt;para meu blog JBake, encontrei um problema aparentemente simples: um teste unitário que falhou com o erro`Wanted but not invoked`. O que parecia ser um bug trivial revelou-se ser um caso de escola perfeito para entender as sutilezas do mocking com Mockito e Kotlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neste artigo, levo você em uma jornada de depuração metódica, onde cada solução revela um novo problema, até a resolução final.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_o_contexto_plugin_gradle_bakery&quot;&gt;O contexto: Plugin Gradle Bakery&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O plugin Bakery é um wrapper em torno do JBake que facilita a publicação de sites estáticos. Aqui está sua estrutura simplificada:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;class BakeryPlugin : Plugin&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt; {
    override fun apply(project: Project) {
        val extension = project.extensions.create(
            &quot;bakery&quot;,
            BakeryExtension::class.java
        )

        project.afterEvaluate {
            if (!project.layout.projectDirectory.asFile
                    .resolve(extension.configPath.get()).exists()) {
                println(&quot;config file does not exists&quot;)
            } else {
                // C&#39;EST ICI QUE ÇA SE PASSE
                project.plugins.apply(JBakePlugin::class.java)

                val site = FileSystemManager.from(project, extension.configPath.get())
                // Configuration de JBake...
            }
        }
    }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O teste que falhava era simples :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;@Test
fun `plugin applies jbake gradle plugin`() {
    val project = createMockProject()
    val plugin = BakeryPlugin()

    plugin.apply(project)

    verify(project.plugins).apply(JBakePlugin::class.java)
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O erro :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-text hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;text&quot;&gt;Wanted but not invoked:
pluginContainer.apply(class org.jbake.gradle.JBakePlugin);
Actually, there were zero interactions with this mock.&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_problema_1_verificar_o_mock_errado&quot;&gt;Problema #1: Verificar o mock errado&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_o_diagnóstico&quot;&gt;O diagnóstico&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/mockito-problem-1.svg&quot; alt=&quot;mockito problem 1&quot; width=&quot;687&quot; height=&quot;521&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O problema: o Mockito não pode rastrear as interações em`project.plugins`porque é apenas um getter que retorna o mock real`mockPluginContainer`. Deve ser feita diretamente na instância do mock&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_a_solução&quot;&gt;A solução&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Modificar`createMockProject()`para retornar os dois objetos :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;private fun createMockProject(): Pair&amp;lt;Project, PluginContainer&amp;gt; {
    val mockPluginContainer = mock&amp;lt;PluginContainer&amp;gt;()
    val mockProject = mock&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt; {
        on { plugins } doReturn mockPluginContainer
    }
    return Pair(mockProject, mockPluginContainer)
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;E adaptar o teste :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;@Test
fun `plugin applies jbake gradle plugin`() {
    val (project, mockPluginContainer) = createMockProject()
    val plugin = BakeryPlugin()

    plugin.apply(project)

    // ✅ Vérification directe sur le bon mock
    verify(mockPluginContainer).apply(JBakePlugin::class.java)
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_problema_2_unfinishedstubbingexception_em_cascata&quot;&gt;Problema #2 : UnfinishedStubbingException em cascata&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_o_diagnóstico_2&quot;&gt;O diagnóstico&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Após a aplicação da primeira correção, um novo erro apareceu:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-text hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;text&quot;&gt;UnfinishedStubbingException:
Unfinished stubbing detected here
Hints:
 3. you are stubbing the behaviour of another mock inside
    before &#39;thenReturn&#39; instruction is completed&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O código problemático usava a sintaxe DSL do Mockito-Kotlin :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;val mockProject = mock&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt; {
    on { extensions } doReturn mockExtensionContainer
    on { plugins } doReturn mockPluginContainer
    on { logger } doReturn mock()  // ❌ PROBLÈME ICI !
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/mockito-problem-2.svg&quot; alt=&quot;mockito problem 2&quot; width=&quot;690&quot; height=&quot;316&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_a_solução_2&quot;&gt;A solução&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Criar&lt;strong&gt;todos&lt;/strong&gt;Os mocks fora de qualquer bloco de stubbing, depois configurá-los com`whenever()`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;private fun createMockProject(): Pair&amp;lt;Project, PluginContainer&amp;gt; {
    // 1️⃣ Créer TOUS les mocks d&#39;abord
    val mockPluginContainer = mock&amp;lt;PluginContainer&amp;gt;()
    val mockExtensionContainer = mock&amp;lt;ExtensionContainer&amp;gt;()
    val mockLogger = mock&amp;lt;org.gradle.api.logging.Logger&amp;gt;()
    val mockProject = mock&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt;()

    // 2️⃣ Configurer les mocks séparément avec whenever()
    whenever(mockProject.plugins).thenReturn(mockPluginContainer)
    whenever(mockProject.extensions).thenReturn(mockExtensionContainer)
    whenever(mockProject.logger).thenReturn(mockLogger)

    return Pair(mockProject, mockPluginContainer)
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock tip&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-tip&quot; title=&quot;Tip&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Regra de ouro&lt;/strong&gt;Nunca chamar`mock()`dentro de um bloco de configuração de mock. Sempre criar os mocks primeiro, depois configurá-los.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_problema_3_o_arquivo_de_configuração_não_existe&quot;&gt;Problema #3: O arquivo de configuração não existe&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_o_diagnóstico_3&quot;&gt;O diagnóstico&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mesmo com os mocks corretos, o teste sempre falhava porque o plugin não encontrava o arquivo de configuração :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;// Dans BakeryPlugin.kt
if (!project.layout.projectDirectory.asFile
        .resolve(extension.configPath.get()).exists()) {
    println(&quot;config file does not exists&quot;)
    return@afterEvaluate  // ❌ Sort avant d&#39;appliquer JBake !
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/mockito-problem-3.svg&quot; alt=&quot;mockito problem 3&quot; width=&quot;605&quot; height=&quot;373&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_a_solução_3&quot;&gt;A solução&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Configurar os mocks para que a resolução do caminho funcione :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;private fun createMockProject(): Pair&amp;lt;Project, PluginContainer&amp;gt; {
    // ... autres mocks ...

    val configFile = File(&quot;../../site.yml&quot;).canonicalFile
    val projectDir = configFile.parentFile

    // Configuration cohérente des chemins
    whenever(mockConfigPathProperty.get()).thenReturn(&quot;site.yml&quot;)
    whenever(mockProjectDirectory.asFile).thenReturn(projectDir)

    // Maintenant : projectDir.resolve(&quot;site.yml&quot;) existe ! ✅
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/path-resolution.svg&quot; alt=&quot;path resolution&quot; width=&quot;1797&quot; height=&quot;5592&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_problema_4_afterevaluate_e_nullpointerexception&quot;&gt;Problema #4 : afterEvaluate e NullPointerException&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_o_diagnóstico_4&quot;&gt;O diagnóstico&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O plugin aplica JBake em um bloco`afterEvaluate`, e acede a`buildDirectory.dir()`:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;project.afterEvaluate {
    // ...
    project.tasks.withType(JBakeTask::class.java)
        .getByName(&quot;bake&quot;).apply {
            output = project.layout.buildDirectory
                .dir(site.bake.destDirPath)  // ❌ NPE ici !
                .get()
                .asFile
        }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O mock de`buildDirectory.dir()&lt;code&gt;retornava`null&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_a_solução_4&quot;&gt;A solução&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;zombar`afterEvaluate`para que ele execute imediatamente e configurar completamente`buildDirectory`(I will output nothing, as there is no provided text to translate.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;private fun createMockProject(): Pair&amp;lt;Project, PluginContainer&amp;gt; {
    // ... autres mocks ...

    val mockBuildDirectory = mock&amp;lt;DirectoryProperty&amp;gt;()
    val buildDir = File(projectDir, &quot;build&quot;)

    // Mocker dir() pour retourner un Provider valide
    whenever(mockBuildDirectory.dir(any&amp;lt;String&amp;gt;())).doAnswer { invocation -&amp;gt;
        val path = invocation.arguments[0] as String
        val mockDirProvider = mock&amp;lt;Provider&amp;lt;Directory&amp;gt;&amp;gt;()
        val mockDir = mock&amp;lt;Directory&amp;gt;()

        whenever(mockDir.asFile).thenReturn(File(buildDir, path))
        whenever(mockDirProvider.get()).thenReturn(mockDir)

        mockDirProvider
    }

    // Mocker afterEvaluate pour exécution immédiate
    whenever(mockProject.afterEvaluate(any&amp;lt;Action&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt;&amp;gt;())).doAnswer { invocation -&amp;gt;
        val action = invocation.arguments[0] as Action&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt;
        action.execute(mockProject)  // ✅ Exécution synchrone
        null
    }

    return Pair(mockProject, mockPluginContainer)
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/after-evaluate-flow.svg&quot; alt=&quot;after evaluate flow&quot; width=&quot;785&quot; height=&quot;357&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_a_solução_completa&quot;&gt;A solução completa&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aqui está a função`createMockProject()`por fim, que resolve todos os problemas :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;private fun createMockProject(): Pair&amp;lt;Project, PluginContainer&amp;gt; {
    // 1️⃣ CRÉER tous les mocks (pas de nested mocks !)
    val mockPluginContainer = mock&amp;lt;PluginContainer&amp;gt;()
    val mockExtensionContainer = mock&amp;lt;ExtensionContainer&amp;gt;()
    val mockLogger = mock&amp;lt;org.gradle.api.logging.Logger&amp;gt;()
    val mockTaskContainer = mock&amp;lt;TaskContainer&amp;gt;()
    val mockConfigPathProperty = mock&amp;lt;Property&amp;lt;String&amp;gt;&amp;gt;()
    val mockBakeryExtension = mock&amp;lt;BakeryExtension&amp;gt;()
    val mockProjectDirectory = mock&amp;lt;Directory&amp;gt;()
    val mockBuildDirectory = mock&amp;lt;DirectoryProperty&amp;gt;()
    val mockProjectLayout = mock&amp;lt;ProjectLayout&amp;gt;()
    val mockProject = mock&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt;()

    // 2️⃣ CONFIGURER la résolution des chemins
    val configFile = File(&quot;../../site.yml&quot;).canonicalFile
    val projectDir = configFile.parentFile
    val buildDir = File(projectDir, &quot;build&quot;)

    whenever(mockConfigPathProperty.get()).thenReturn(&quot;site.yml&quot;)
    whenever(mockConfigPathProperty.isPresent).thenReturn(true)
    whenever(mockBakeryExtension.configPath).thenReturn(mockConfigPathProperty)
    whenever(mockProjectDirectory.asFile).thenReturn(projectDir)

    // 3️⃣ CONFIGURER buildDirectory avec dir()
    whenever(mockBuildDirectory.dir(any&amp;lt;String&amp;gt;())).doAnswer { invocation -&amp;gt;
        val path = invocation.arguments[0] as String
        val mockDirProvider = mock&amp;lt;Provider&amp;lt;Directory&amp;gt;&amp;gt;()
        val mockDir = mock&amp;lt;Directory&amp;gt;()
        whenever(mockDir.asFile).thenReturn(File(buildDir, path))
        whenever(mockDirProvider.get()).thenReturn(mockDir)
        mockDirProvider
    }

    // 4️⃣ ASSEMBLER le projet
    whenever(mockProjectLayout.projectDirectory).thenReturn(mockProjectDirectory)
    whenever(mockProjectLayout.buildDirectory).thenReturn(mockBuildDirectory)

    whenever(mockExtensionContainer.create(&quot;bakery&quot;, BakeryExtension::class.java))
        .thenReturn(mockBakeryExtension)
    whenever(mockExtensionContainer.getByType(BakeryExtension::class.java))
        .thenReturn(mockBakeryExtension)

    whenever(mockProject.extensions).thenReturn(mockExtensionContainer)
    whenever(mockProject.plugins).thenReturn(mockPluginContainer)
    whenever(mockProject.tasks).thenReturn(mockTaskContainer)
    whenever(mockProject.layout).thenReturn(mockProjectLayout)
    whenever(mockProject.logger).thenReturn(mockLogger)
    whenever(mockProject.projectDir).thenReturn(projectDir)

    // 5️⃣ CONFIGURER afterEvaluate pour exécution immédiate
    whenever(mockProject.afterEvaluate(any&amp;lt;Action&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt;&amp;gt;())).doAnswer { invocation -&amp;gt;
        val action = invocation.arguments[0] as Action&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt;
        action.execute(mockProject)
        null
    }

    return Pair(mockProject, mockPluginContainer)
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;E o teste final que passa :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;@Test
fun `plugin applies jbake gradle plugin`() {
    val (project, mockPluginContainer) = createMockProject()
    val plugin = BakeryPlugin()

    plugin.apply(project)

    verify(mockPluginContainer).apply(JBakePlugin::class.java) // ✅ SUCCÈS !
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_lições_aprendidas&quot;&gt;Lições aprendidas&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/lessons-learned.svg&quot; alt=&quot;lessons learned&quot; width=&quot;748&quot; height=&quot;472&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_verificar_o_mock_correto&quot;&gt;Verificar o mock correto&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;// ❌ FAUX
verify(project.plugins).apply(JBakePlugin::class.java)

// ✅ CORRECT
val (project, mockPluginContainer) = createMockProject()
verify(mockPluginContainer).apply(JBakePlugin::class.java)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_2_evitar_os_mocks_aninhados&quot;&gt;2. Evitar os mocks aninhados&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;// ❌ FAUX - UnfinishedStubbingException
val mockProject = mock&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt; {
    on { logger } doReturn mock()  // Nested mock creation !
}

// ✅ CORRECT - Créer séparément
val mockLogger = mock&amp;lt;org.gradle.api.logging.Logger&amp;gt;()
val mockProject = mock&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt;()
whenever(mockProject.logger).thenReturn(mockLogger)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_3_simular_os_callbacks_de_avaliação&quot;&gt;3. Simular os callbacks de avaliação&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;// ✅ afterEvaluate doit s&#39;exécuter pour les tests
whenever(mockProject.afterEvaluate(any())).doAnswer { invocation -&amp;gt;
    val action = invocation.arguments[0] as Action&amp;lt;Project&amp;gt;
    action.execute(mockProject)
    null
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_4_testar_a_resolução_dos_caminhos&quot;&gt;4. Testar a resolução dos caminhos&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlightjs highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin hljs&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;// Toujours vérifier que les chemins se résolvent correctement
val extension = project.extensions.getByType(BakeryExtension::class.java)
val configPath = extension.configPath.get()
val projectDir = project.layout.projectDirectory.asFile
val resolvedConfig = projectDir.resolve(configPath)

println(&quot;Resolved config: ${resolvedConfig.absolutePath}&quot;)
println(&quot;Exists: ${resolvedConfig.exists()}&quot;)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_arquitetura_de_teste_final&quot;&gt;Arquitetura de teste final&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;imageblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;img src=&quot;./images/test-architecture.svg&quot; alt=&quot;test architecture&quot; width=&quot;1758&quot; height=&quot;5468&quot;&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_conclusão&quot;&gt;Conclusão&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O que parecia ser um simples problema de teste acabou sendo um excelente caso de estudo sobre:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As sutilezas do Mockito com Kotlin&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A importância de mockar os objetos corretos&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A gestão de callbacks assíncronos nos testes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A resolução de caminhos nos plugins Gradle&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A depuração metódica, ao compreender cada camada do problema, permitiu chegar a uma solução robusta e manutenível.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;admonitionblock tip&quot;&gt;
&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;icon&quot;&gt;
&lt;i class=&quot;fa icon-tip&quot; title=&quot;Tip&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Conselho para seus testes&lt;/strong&gt;Se você encontrar &quot;Wanted but not invoked&quot; com Mockito, pergunte-se sempre :
1. Estou verificando o mock certo?
2. Todos os meus mocks são criados fora dos blocos de configuração?
3. Meus callbacks se executam realmente?
4. É que meus caminhos se resolvem corretamente?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_recursos&quot;&gt;Recursos&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/mockito/mockito-kotlin&quot;&gt;Documentação do Mockito-Kotlin&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.gradle.org/current/userguide/custom_plugins.html&quot;&gt;Guia de desenvolvimento de plugins do Gradle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jbake.org/&quot;&gt;JBake Gerador de Sites Estáticos&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Você encontrou problemas semelhantes nos seus testes? Compartilhe sua experiência nos comentários!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;toc&quot; class=&quot;toc&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;toctitle&quot;&gt;Sommaire&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_introdução&quot;&gt;Introdução&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_o_que_é_a_mónada_either&quot;&gt;O que é a mónada Either ?&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_por_que_usar_either&quot;&gt;Por que usar Either?&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_contexto&quot;&gt;Contexto&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_as_diferentes_abordagens&quot;&gt;As diferentes abordagens&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_a_abordagem_clássica_com_when&quot;&gt;A abordagem clássica com `when&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_uso_de_fold_para_uma_abordagem_mais_concisa&quot;&gt;Uso de &lt;code&gt;fold&lt;/code&gt; para uma abordagem mais concisa&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_transformação_com_map_e_mapleft&quot;&gt;Transformação com &lt;code&gt;map&lt;/code&gt; e `mapLeft&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_tratamento_de_erros_com_getorelse&quot;&gt;Tratamento de erros com `getOrElse&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_ações_laterais_com_onleft_e_onright&quot;&gt;Ações laterais com &lt;code&gt;onLeft&lt;/code&gt; e `onRight&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_encadeamento_de_operações_com_flatmap&quot;&gt;Encadeamento de operações com `flatMap&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_transformação_bidirecional_com_bimap&quot;&gt;Transformação bidirecional com `bimap&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_inversão_dos_lados_com_swap&quot;&gt;Inversão dos lados com `swap&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_utilização_de_tap_e_tapleft&quot;&gt;Utilização de &lt;code&gt;tap&lt;/code&gt; e &lt;code&gt;tapLeft&lt;/code&gt; :&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_utilização_de_recover&quot;&gt;Utilização de &lt;code&gt;recover&lt;/code&gt; :&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_casos_de_uso_práticos&quot;&gt;Casos de uso práticos&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_conclusão&quot;&gt;Conclusão&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_para_ir_além&quot;&gt;Para ir além&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_introdução&quot;&gt;Introdução&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;_Público-alvo : _ Desenvolvedores Kotlin de nível intermediário a avançado.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No mundo da programação funcional em Kotlin, a biblioteca Arrow oferece ferramentas poderosas para lidar com erros e casos alternativos. Entre essas ferramentas, a mônada`Either`destaca-se pela sua capacidade de representar dois estados possíveis: sucesso (Right) ou fracasso (Left). Mas como navegar eficientemente entre esses dois estados? É isto que vamos explorar neste artigo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_o_que_é_a_mónada_either&quot;&gt;O que é a mónada Either ?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A mônada`Either`é uma estrutura de dados que representa duas possibilidades mutualmente exclusivas. Em Kotlin com Arrow, ela é frequentemente usada para lidar com os casos de sucesso e de falha de uma operação, oferecendo uma alternativa elegante às exceções tradicionais.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_por_que_usar_either&quot;&gt;Por que usar Either?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Gerenciamento explícito de erros: Obriga o desenvolvedor a considerar os casos de erro.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Composição funcional: facilita o encadeamento de operações que podem falhar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Type‑safety : Os erros são tipados, o que ajuda a manipulá-los de maneira mais precisa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sem exceções: Evite efeitos colaterais e interrupções inesperadas do fluxo de execução.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_contexto&quot;&gt;Contexto&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Imagine que você está desenvolvendo uma API REST comhttps://spring.io/projects/spring-boot/[Spring Boot,windows=ler-mais-tarde] et &lt;a href=&quot;https://kotlinlang.org/&quot;&gt;Kotlin&lt;/a&gt;, usando a bibliotecahttps://arrow-kt.io/[Arrow,janelas=ler-mais-tarde]. Você tem uma função`findOneUserByEmail`que retorna um`Either&amp;lt;Throwable, User&amp;gt;`. Como você pode tratar esse resultado de forma elegante e funcional?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Temos uma classe User :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;@file:Suppress(
    &quot;RemoveRedundantQualifierName&quot;,
    &quot;MemberVisibilityCanBePrivate&quot;,
    &quot;SqlNoDataSourceInspection&quot;
)

package webapp.users

import arrow.core.Either
import arrow.core.left
import arrow.core.right
import com.fasterxml.jackson.annotation.JsonIgnore
import com.fasterxml.jackson.databind.ObjectMapper
import jakarta.validation.constraints.NotNull
import jakarta.validation.constraints.Pattern
import jakarta.validation.constraints.Size
import org.springframework.beans.factory.getBean
import org.springframework.context.ApplicationContext
import org.springframework.data.r2dbc.core.R2dbcEntityTemplate
import org.springframework.r2dbc.core.DatabaseClient
import org.springframework.r2dbc.core.awaitOne
import org.springframework.r2dbc.core.awaitRowsUpdated
import webapp.core.property.ANONYMOUS_USER
import webapp.core.property.EMPTY_STRING
import webapp.core.utils.AppUtils.cleanField
import webapp.users.EntityModel.Companion.ID_MEMBER
import webapp.users.User.UserDao.Attributes.EMAIL_ATTR
import webapp.users.User.UserDao.Attributes.ID_ATTR
import webapp.users.User.UserDao.Attributes.LANG_KEY_ATTR
import webapp.users.User.UserDao.Attributes.LOGIN_ATTR
import webapp.users.User.UserDao.Attributes.PASSWORD_ATTR
import webapp.users.User.UserDao.Attributes.VERSION_ATTR
import webapp.users.User.UserDao.Constraints.LOGIN_REGEX
import webapp.users.User.UserDao.Fields.EMAIL_FIELD
import webapp.users.User.UserDao.Fields.ID_FIELD
import webapp.users.User.UserDao.Fields.LANG_KEY_FIELD
import webapp.users.User.UserDao.Fields.LOGIN_FIELD
import webapp.users.User.UserDao.Fields.PASSWORD_FIELD
import webapp.users.User.UserDao.Fields.VERSION_FIELD
import webapp.users.User.UserDao.Relations.INSERT
import webapp.users.security.Role
import webapp.users.security.Role.RoleDao
import webapp.users.security.UserRole.UserRoleDao
import java.util.*
import jakarta.validation.constraints.Email as EmailConstraint

data class User(
    override val id: UUID? = null,

    @field:NotNull
    @field:Pattern(regexp = LOGIN_REGEX)
    @field:Size(min = 1, max = 50)
    val login: String,

    @JsonIgnore
    @field:NotNull
    @field:Size(min = 60, max = 60)
    val password: String = EMPTY_STRING,

    @field:EmailConstraint
    @field:Size(min = 5, max = 254)
    val email: String = EMPTY_STRING,

    @JsonIgnore
    val roles: MutableSet&amp;lt;Role&amp;gt; = mutableSetOf(Role(ANONYMOUS_USER)),

    @field:Size(min = 2, max = 10)
    val langKey: String = EMPTY_STRING,

    @JsonIgnore
    val version: Long = -1,
) : EntityModel&amp;lt;UUID&amp;gt;() {

    companion object {
        @JvmStatic
        fun main(args: Array&amp;lt;String&amp;gt;) = println(UserDao.Relations.sqlScript)
    }

    object UserDao {
        object Constraints {
            // Regex for acceptable logins
            const val LOGIN_REGEX =
                &quot;^(?&amp;gt;[a-zA-Z0-9!$&amp;amp;*+=?^_`{|}~.-]+@[a-zA-Z0-9-]+(?:\\.[a-zA-Z0-9-]+)*)|(?&amp;gt;[_.@A-Za-z0-9-]+)$&quot;
            const val PASSWORD_MIN: Int = 4
            const val PASSWORD_MAX: Int = 16
            const val IMAGE_URL_DEFAULT = &quot;https://placehold.it/50x50&quot;
            const val PHONE_REGEX = &quot;^(\\+|00)?[1-9]\\d{0,49}\$&quot;
        }

        object Members {
            const val PASSWORD_MEMBER = &quot;password&quot;
            const val ROLES_MEMBER = &quot;roles&quot;
        }

        object Fields {
            const val ID_FIELD = &quot;`id`&quot;
            const val LOGIN_FIELD = &quot;`login`&quot;
            const val PASSWORD_FIELD = &quot;`password`&quot;
            const val EMAIL_FIELD = &quot;`email`&quot;
            const val LANG_KEY_FIELD = &quot;`lang_key`&quot;
            const val VERSION_FIELD = &quot;`version`&quot;
        }

        object Attributes {
            val ID_ATTR = ID_FIELD.cleanField()
            val LOGIN_ATTR = LOGIN_FIELD.cleanField()
            val PASSWORD_ATTR = PASSWORD_FIELD.cleanField()
            val EMAIL_ATTR = EMAIL_FIELD.cleanField()
            const val LANG_KEY_ATTR = &quot;langKey&quot;
            val VERSION_ATTR = VERSION_FIELD.cleanField()
        }

        object Relations {
            const val TABLE_NAME = &quot;`user`&quot;
            const val SQL_SCRIPT = &quot;&quot;&quot;
            CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS $TABLE_NAME (
                $ID_FIELD                     UUID default random_uuid() PRIMARY KEY,
                $LOGIN_FIELD                  VARCHAR,
                $PASSWORD_FIELD               VARCHAR,
                $EMAIL_FIELD                  VARCHAR,
                $LANG_KEY_FIELD               VARCHAR,
                $VERSION_FIELD                bigint
            );
            CREATE UNIQUE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS `uniq_idx_user_login`
            ON $TABLE_NAME ($LOGIN_FIELD);
            CREATE UNIQUE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS `uniq_idx_user_email`
            ON $TABLE_NAME ($EMAIL_FIELD);
&quot;&quot;&quot;

            @Suppress(&quot;SqlDialectInspection&quot;)
            const val INSERT = &quot;&quot;&quot;
            insert into $TABLE_NAME (
                $LOGIN_FIELD, $EMAIL_FIELD,
                $PASSWORD_FIELD, $LANG_KEY_FIELD,
                $VERSION_FIELD
            ) values ( :login, :email, :password, :langKey, :version)&quot;&quot;&quot;

            @JvmStatic
            val sqlScript: String
                get() = setOf(
                    UserDao.Relations.SQL_SCRIPT,
                    RoleDao.Relations.SQL_SCRIPT,
                    UserRoleDao.Relations.SQL_SCRIPT
                ).joinToString(&quot;&quot;)
                    .trimMargin()
        }

        object Dao {
            val Pair&amp;lt;User, ApplicationContext&amp;gt;.toJson: String
                get() = second.getBean&amp;lt;ObjectMapper&amp;gt;().writeValueAsString(first)

            suspend fun Pair&amp;lt;User, ApplicationContext&amp;gt;.save(): Either&amp;lt;Throwable, Long&amp;gt; = try {
                second.getBean&amp;lt;R2dbcEntityTemplate&amp;gt;()
                    .databaseClient
                    .sql(INSERT)
                    .bind(LOGIN_ATTR, first.login)
                    .bind(EMAIL_ATTR, first.email)
                    .bind(PASSWORD_ATTR, first.password)
                    .bind(LANG_KEY_ATTR, first.langKey)
                    .bind(VERSION_ATTR, first.version)
                    .fetch()
                    .awaitRowsUpdated()
                    .right()
            } catch (e: Throwable) {
                e.left()
            }


            suspend fun ApplicationContext.findOneUserByEmail(
                email: String
            ): Either&amp;lt;Throwable, User&amp;gt; = try {
                getBean&amp;lt;DatabaseClient&amp;gt;()
                    .sql(&quot;SELECT * FROM `user` WHERE LOWER(email) = LOWER(:email)&quot;)
                    .bind(&quot;email&quot;, email)
                    .fetch()
                    .awaitOne()
                    .let { row -&amp;gt;
                        User(
                            id = row[ID_ATTR] as UUID?,
                            login = row[LOGIN_ATTR] as String,
                            password = row[PASSWORD_ATTR] as String,
                            email = row[EMAIL_ATTR] as String,
                            langKey = row[LANG_KEY_ATTR] as String,
                            version = row[VERSION_ATTR] as Long
                        )
                    }.right()
            } catch (e: Throwable) {
                e.left()
            }
        }
    }

    /** Account REST API URIs */
    object UserRestApis {
        const val API_AUTHORITY = &quot;/api/authorities&quot;
        const val API_USERS = &quot;/api/users&quot;
        const val API_SIGNUP = &quot;/signup&quot;
        const val API_SIGNUP_PATH = &quot;$API_USERS$API_SIGNUP&quot;
        const val API_ACTIVATE = &quot;/activate&quot;
        const val API_ACTIVATE_PATH = &quot;$API_USERS$API_ACTIVATE?key=&quot;
        const val API_ACTIVATE_PARAM = &quot;{activationKey}&quot;
        const val API_ACTIVATE_KEY = &quot;key&quot;
        const val API_RESET_INIT = &quot;/reset-password/init&quot;
        const val API_RESET_FINISH = &quot;/reset-password/finish&quot;
        const val API_CHANGE = &quot;/change-password&quot;
        const val API_CHANGE_PATH = &quot;$API_USERS$API_CHANGE&quot;
    }
}

// Abstract entity model with Generic ID, which can be of any type
abstract class EntityModel&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;(
    open val id: T? = null
) {
    companion object {
        const val ID_MEMBER = &quot;id&quot;
    }
}

// Generic extension function that allows the ID to be applied to any EntityModel type
inline fun &amp;lt;reified T : EntityModel&amp;lt;ID&amp;gt;, ID&amp;gt; T.withId(id: ID): T {
    // Use reflection to create a copy with the passed ID
    return this::class.constructors.first { it.parameters.any { param -&amp;gt; param.name == ID_MEMBER } }
        .call(id, *this::class.constructors.first().parameters.drop(1).map { param -&amp;gt;
            this::class.members.first { member -&amp;gt; member.name == param.name }.call(this)
        }.toTypedArray())
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_as_diferentes_abordagens&quot;&gt;As diferentes abordagens&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_a_abordagem_clássica_com_when&quot;&gt;A abordagem clássica com `when&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;val user: User by lazy { userFactory(USER) }

val result: Either&amp;lt;Throwable, User&amp;gt; = context.findOneUserByEmail(user.email)

when (result) {
    is Either.Left -&amp;gt; {
        val error = result.value
        println(&quot;Erreur : ${error.message}&quot;)
    }
    is Either.Right -&amp;gt; {
        val user = result.value
        println(&quot;Utilisateur trouvé : ${user.login}&quot;)
    }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Este método, embora simples e legível, não aproveita plenamente as capacidades funcionais do Arrow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_uso_de_fold_para_uma_abordagem_mais_concisa&quot;&gt;Uso de &lt;code&gt;fold&lt;/code&gt; para uma abordagem mais concisa&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;result.fold(
{ error -&amp;gt; println(&quot;Erreur : ${error.message}&quot;) },
{ user -&amp;gt; println(&quot;Utilisateur trouvé : ${user.login}&quot;) }
)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`fold`permite definir ações para os dois casos (Left e Right) de forma concisa e elegante.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_transformação_com_map_e_mapleft&quot;&gt;Transformação com &lt;code&gt;map&lt;/code&gt; e `mapLeft&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;val processedResult = result
    .map { user -&amp;gt; &quot;Utilisateur trouvé : ${user.login}&quot; }
    .mapLeft { error -&amp;gt; &quot;Erreur : ${error.message}&quot; }

println(processedResult.merge())&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Esta abordagem permite transformar os valores contidos em Either, preservando sua estrutura, ideal para cadeias de processamento mais complexas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_tratamento_de_erros_com_getorelse&quot;&gt;Tratamento de erros com `getOrElse&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;val user = result.getOrElse { error -&amp;gt;
    println(&quot;Erreur : ${error.message}&quot;)
    User(login = &quot;default&quot;, email = &quot;default@example.com&quot;) // utilisateur par défaut
}
println(&quot;Login : ${user.login}&quot;)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`getOrElse`oferece um tratamento elegante de erros ao permitir fornecer um valor padrão.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_ações_laterais_com_onleft_e_onright&quot;&gt;Ações laterais com &lt;code&gt;onLeft&lt;/code&gt; e `onRight&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;result.onLeft { error -&amp;gt; println(&quot;Erreur : ${error.message}&quot;) }
.onRight { user -&amp;gt; println(&quot;Utilisateur trouvé : ${user.login}&quot;) }&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Esses métodos permitem executar ações em cada lado sem modificar o Either, perfeito para o registro ou os efeitos secundários leves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_encadeamento_de_operações_com_flatmap&quot;&gt;Encadeamento de operações com `flatMap&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;fun findUser(email: String): Either&amp;lt;Throwable, User&amp;gt; = // ... implémentation

fun getUserPermissions(user: User): Either&amp;lt;Throwable, List&amp;lt;String&amp;gt;&amp;gt; = // ... implémentation

val userPermissions = findUser(&quot;user@example.com&quot;)
    .flatMap { user -&amp;gt; getUserPermissions(user) }&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;flatMap`é útil para encadear operações que retornam elas próprias`Either&lt;/code&gt;, evitando assim os`Either`aninhados.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_transformação_bidirecional_com_bimap&quot;&gt;Transformação bidirecional com `bimap&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;val result: Either&amp;lt;Throwable, User&amp;gt; = // ... obtention du résultat
val processedResult = result.bimap(
    { error -&amp;gt; &quot;Erreur: ${error.message}&quot; },
    { user -&amp;gt; &quot;Utilisateur: ${user.login}&quot; }
)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;`bimap`permite transformar tanto o lado esquerdo quanto o lado direito em uma única operação.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_inversão_dos_lados_com_swap&quot;&gt;Inversão dos lados com `swap&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;val result: Either&amp;lt;Throwable, User&amp;gt; = // ... obtention du résultat
val swapped = result.swap()&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;swap`é útil quando você quiser inverter os lados de um`Either&lt;/code&gt;, por exemplo para adaptar a interface de uma função para outra.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_utilização_de_tap_e_tapleft&quot;&gt;Utilização de &lt;code&gt;tap&lt;/code&gt; e &lt;code&gt;tapLeft&lt;/code&gt; :&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;result.tap { user -&amp;gt; println(&quot;Utilisateur trouvé : ${user.login}&quot;) }
.tapLeft { error -&amp;gt; println(&quot;Erreur : ${error.message}&quot;) }&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Similar a`onLeft` et &lt;code&gt;onRight&lt;/code&gt;, mas esses métodos retornam o Either original, o que é útil para o encadeamento de operações.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_utilização_de_recover&quot;&gt;Utilização de &lt;code&gt;recover&lt;/code&gt; :&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-kotlin&quot; data-lang=&quot;kotlin&quot;&gt;val recoveredUser = result.recover { error -&amp;gt;
    println(&quot;Erreur récupérée : ${error.message}&quot;)
    User(login = &quot;recovered&quot;, email = &quot;recovered@example.com&quot;)
}
println(&quot;Login : ${recoveredUser.login}&quot;)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Este método permite transformar um Either.Left em Either.Right fornecendo um valor de substituição.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_casos_de_uso_práticos&quot;&gt;Casos de uso práticos&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Utilize`fold`para operações simples que exigem um tratamento para cada caso. - Prefiram`map` et &lt;code&gt;mapLeft`para transformações de dados sem mudar a estrutura da`Either&lt;/code&gt;. - Opte por`flatMap`durante o encadeamento de operações que podem falhar. Use`recover`para fornecer um valor padrão em caso de erro. Escolha`onLeft` et &lt;code&gt;onRight&lt;/code&gt; (ou &lt;code&gt;tap&lt;/code&gt; et &lt;code&gt;tapLeft&lt;/code&gt;) para efeitos colaterais como logging. Use`bimap`para transformar os dois lados em uma única operação. - Aplique`swap`quando você precisar adaptar a interface de uma função para outra.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_conclusão&quot;&gt;Conclusão&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cada uma dessas abordagens tem suas vantagens de acordo com o contexto de uso. Os métodos como`fold`, &lt;code&gt;map&lt;/code&gt;/&lt;code&gt;mapLeft&lt;/code&gt;, et `recover`são particularmente úteis quando você deseja encadear várias operações ou transformar os dados de forma funcional.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A mônade`Either`O d&amp;#8217;Arrow oferece uma flexibilidade notável para lidar com os casos de sucesso e erro em suas aplicações Kotlin. Ao dominar essas diferentes abordagens, você será capaz de escrever um código mais robusto, mais legível e mais funcional.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No seu próximo projeto, não hesite em explorar essas técnicas para tirar o máximo proveito da programação funcional com Kotlin e Arrow!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_para_ir_além&quot;&gt;Para ir além&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Documentação oficial do Arrow :https://arrow-kt.io/docs/apidocs/arrow-core/arrow.core/-either/[Seta Ou] - Kotlin Coroutines com Arrow :https://arrow-kt.io/docs/fx/[Flecha Fx Corrotinas]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Não se esqueça de compartilhar suas experiências e suas técnicas favoritas para trabalhar com`Either`nos comentários abaixo !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;toc&quot; class=&quot;toc&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;toctitle&quot;&gt;Sommaire&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_introdução&quot;&gt;Introdução&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_utilização_do_comando_find&quot;&gt;Utilização do comando `find&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_opções_adicionais_para_find&quot;&gt;Opções adicionais para `find&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_utilização_do_comando_locate&quot;&gt;Utilização do comando `locate&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_uso_do_comando_grep_para_pesquisar_texto_em_arquivos&quot;&gt;Uso do comando &lt;code&gt;grep&lt;/code&gt; para pesquisar texto em arquivos&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_conclusão&quot;&gt;Conclusão&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_introdução&quot;&gt;Introdução&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;A problemática : Procurar ficheiros num sistema operativo Linux através do terminal.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neste artigo, vamos explorar como pesquisar um arquivo no Ubuntu usando um terminal Zsh. Zsh (Z shell) é um interpretador de comandos poderoso e amplamente utilizado por sua flexibilidade e recursos avançados.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ubuntu, uma distribuição Linux popular, oferece várias ferramentas de linha de comando para pesquisar arquivos. Veremos como usar comandos tais como`find`, &lt;code&gt;locate&lt;/code&gt; et `grep`para localizar arquivos rapidamente e eficientemente no terminal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_utilização_do_comando_find&quot;&gt;Utilização do comando `find&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O comando`find`permite pesquisar arquivos em um diretório específico e seus subdiretórios. Sua sintaxe básica é a seguinte:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;find [chemin] -name [nom_du_fichier]&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aqui está um exemplo prático onde estamos pesquisando por um arquivo chamado`example.txt`no diretório`/home` :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;find /home -name &quot;example.txt&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Este comando vai percorrer todos os subdiretórios de`/home`e exibir o caminho completo do arquivo se for encontrado.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manual online do comando`find`:https://man.archlinux.org/man/find.1.fr/[manual encontrar,janelas=ler-mais-tarde]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_opções_adicionais_para_find&quot;&gt;Opções adicionais para `find&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O comando`find`é muito poderosa e dispõe de muitas opções. Aqui estão alguns exemplos úteis:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pesquisar por tipo de arquivo&lt;/strong&gt;: Para pesquisar apenas arquivos, use`-type f`, e para pesquisar diretórios, use`-type d`. - &lt;strong&gt;Pesquisar por tamanho&lt;/strong&gt;Você também pode filtrar os arquivos de acordo com o tamanho usando a opção`-size`. Par exemple, pour rechercher des fichiers de plus de 100 Mo, utilisez :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;find /home -size +100M&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_utilização_do_comando_locate&quot;&gt;Utilização do comando `locate&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O comando`locate`é mais rápido que`find`Porque ela utiliza um banco de dados pré-indexado dos arquivos presentes no sistema. Você deve primeiro atualizar este banco de dados com o seguinte comando :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;sudo updatedb&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Em seguida, você pode procurar um arquivo assim:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;locate example.txt&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eu usohttps://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Z_Shell[zsh]comhttps://github.com/ohmyzsh/ohmyzsh/wiki[oh-my-zsh], parece que o pedido`locate`não é acessível a partir de`zsh`mas possível desde`bash`, para lidar com isso, o argumento`-c`da encomenda`bash`permite executar um comando`bash`desde outro tipo de terminal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Aqui estou procurando os arquivos que terminam com o padrão`001.pdf`no diretório do usuário&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;bash -c &quot;locate ~/*001.pdf&quot;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manual online do comando`locate` : &lt;a href=&quot;https://man.archlinux.org/man/locate.1.fr/&quot;&gt;man localizar&lt;/a&gt;*&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_uso_do_comando_grep_para_pesquisar_texto_em_arquivos&quot;&gt;Uso do comando &lt;code&gt;grep&lt;/code&gt; para pesquisar texto em arquivos&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Se você quiser pesquisar um texto específico dentro de um arquivo, você pode usar`grep`. Por exemplo, para pesquisar a ocorrência da palavra &quot;Ubuntu&quot; em todos os arquivos`.txt`do diretório atual, use :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;grep &quot;Ubuntu&quot; *.txt&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_conclusão&quot;&gt;Conclusão&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A pesquisa de arquivos no Ubuntu por meio de um terminal Zsh pode ser feita usando várias ferramentas poderosas.`find`é flexível e oferece uma multitude de opções, enquanto`locate`permite uma pesquisa rápida usando uma base de dados pré-construída. Finalmente,`grep`permite encontrar ocorrências de texto dentro dos arquivos.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Esses comandos oferecem uma gama completa de ferramentas para tornar suas pesquisas de arquivos mais eficientes e adaptadas às suas necessidades, e cada um desses comandos possui um manual visível com o comando`man`&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;toc&quot; class=&quot;toc&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;toctitle&quot;&gt;Sommaire&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_o_teclado&quot;&gt;O teclado :&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;sectlevel2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_a_tecla_ctrl&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;a tecla &amp;lt;Ctrl&amp;gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_permissãoautorização&quot;&gt;Permissão(autorização)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_pesquisa_de_arquivos&quot;&gt;Pesquisa de arquivos&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_o_teclado&quot;&gt;O teclado :&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect2&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&quot;_a_tecla_ctrl&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;a tecla &amp;lt;Ctrl&amp;gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;table class=&quot;tableblock frame-all grid-all stretch&quot;&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://korben.info/les-raccourcis-clavier-pour-bash-terminal-linux-et-macos.html&quot;&gt;link&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://blogmotion.fr/systeme/astuces-bash-linux-16175&quot;&gt;outro link&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_permissãoautorização&quot;&gt;Permissão(autorização)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CHMOD é utilizado para alterar as permissões de um ficheiro.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PERMISSÃO      COMANDO&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;U   G   W rwx rwx rwx     chmod 777 filename rwx rwx r-x     chmod 775 filename rwx r-x r-x     chmod 755 filename rw- rw- r--     chmod 664 filename rw- r-- r--     chmod 644 filename&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;U = utilizador G = Grupo W = Mundo&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;r = Readable w = gravável x = executável - = sem permissão&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Outra forma de ver as permissões:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;400     lido por proprietário 040     lido pelo grupo 004     lido por qualquer pessoa (outra) 200 escrito pelo proprietário 020     escrever por grupo 002     escrever por qualquer pessoa 100     executar pelo proprietário 010     executar por grupo 001     execute by anybody&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Para obter uma combinação, basta somá‑los.&lt;br&gt;
Por exemplo, para ser lido, escrito, executado pelo proprietário,&lt;br&gt;
lido, executado, por grupo e executado por qualquer pessoa,&lt;br&gt;
você adicionaria 400+200+100+040+010+001 para dar 751.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_pesquisa_de_arquivos&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;/blog/2024/0074_seach_file_linux_post.html&quot;&gt;Pesquisa de arquivos&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;

&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;preamble&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tempo de leitura : 3 min&lt;/em&gt; Pandoc um conversor universal de documento&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Pandoc é um software de processamento de texto open source que pode ser usado para converter documentos entre diferentes formatos. Existem várias maneiras de instalar o Pandoc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_instalação_a_partir_da_página_de_download&quot;&gt;Instalação a partir da página de download&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Para instalar o Pandoc a partir da página de download, siga estas etapas:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Acesse a página de download do Pandoc :https://pandoc.org/installing.html/[&lt;a href=&quot;https://pandoc.org/installing.html&quot; class=&quot;bare&quot;&gt;https://pandoc.org/installing.html&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Faça o download do instalador do pacote para o seu sistema operacional.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Execute o instalador para instalar Pandoc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instalação a partir de um arquivo zip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Para instalar Pandoc a partir de um arquivo zip, siga os passos abaixo:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Faça o download do arquivo zip contendo os binários do Pandoc e a documentação.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Descompacte o arquivo zip.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mova os binários para um diretório da sua escolha.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instalação usando Chocolatey&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Para instalar o Pandoc usando o Chocolatey, siga estes passos:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Abra um prompt de comando.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Execute o comando seguinte:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-powershell&quot; data-lang=&quot;powershell&quot;&gt;choco install pandoc&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instalação usando o winget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Para instalar o Pandoc usando o winget, siga estas etapas :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Abra um prompt de comando.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Execute o seguinte comando :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-powershell&quot; data-lang=&quot;powershell&quot;&gt;winget install --source winget --exact --id JohnMacFarlane.Pandoc&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recomendações&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Por padrão, o Pandoc cria PDFs usando LaTeX. É recomendado instalar o LaTeX via MiKTeX. Com a opção`--pdf-engine`, você pode, porém, especificar outros programas para esta tarefa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advertência&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O uso de vários métodos de instalação pode resultar em duas instalações distintas do Pandoc. É recomendado desinstalar corretamente o Pandoc antes de passar para um método de instalação alternativo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instalação no Linux via WSL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifique se a versão do pandoc no seu gerenciador de pacotes não está obsoleta. Pandoc está nos repositórios do Debian, Ubuntu, Slackware, Arch, Fedora, NixOS, openSUSE, gentoo e Void.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Para obter a última versão, oferecemos um pacote binário para a arquitetura amd64 na página de download.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O executável está vinculado estaticamente e não possui dependências dinâmicas nem dependências de arquivos de dados externos. Nota: devido ao link estático, o binário pandoc deste pacote não pode usar os filtros lua que exigem módulos lua externos escritos em C.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Um tarball e um instalador deb são fornecidos. Para instalar o deb :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;sudo dpkg -i $DEB&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exemplo no momento da escrita:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;wget https://github.com/jgm/pandoc/releases/download/3.1.11.1/pandoc-3.1.11.1-1-amd64.deb&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;sudo dpkg -i pandoc-3.1.11.1-1-amd64.deb&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;où `$DEB`é o caminho para o deb baixado Isso instalará o executável`pandoc`e a página do manual.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Se você utiliza uma distribuição baseada em RPM, talvez consiga instalar o .deb da nossa página de download usando o alien.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Em qualquer distribuição, você pode instalar a partir do tarball em`$DEST`(por exemplo,&lt;code&gt;/usr/local/&lt;/code&gt; ou &lt;code&gt;$HOME/.local&lt;/code&gt;) ao fazer :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;tar xvzf $TGZ --strip-components 1 -C $DEST&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;où `$TGZ`é o caminho para o tarball zip baixado. Para as versões do Pandoc anteriores a 2.0, que não fornecem um tarball, experimente em vez disso :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;ar p $DEB data.tar.gz | tar xvz --strip-components 2 -C $DEST&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Você também pode instalar a partir do código-fonte, usando as instruções abaixo sob`Compilation à partir de la source`. Note que a maioria das distribuições tem o Haskell Platform nos seus repositórios de pacotes. Por exemplo, no Debian/Ubuntu, você pode instalá-lo com&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;apt-get install haskell-platform&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Por padrão, o Pandoc cria PDFs usando LaTeX. Recomendamos que instale o TeX Live via o seu gestor de pacotes. (No Debian/Ubuntu,&lt;code&gt;apt-get install texlive&lt;/code&gt;) Com a opção`--pdf-engine`, você pode, no entanto, especificar outros programas para esta tarefa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;preamble&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tempo de leitura : 2 min&lt;/em&gt; Criar uma implementação completa da classe kotlin.Triple em JavaScript, TypeScript e Python utilizando a programação funcional.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nota :&lt;/strong&gt;Os tipos`Maybe`, &lt;code&gt;Either&lt;/code&gt;, `Result`não fazem parte da linguagem de base em JavaScript ou TypeScript, portanto precisamos implementá-los nós mesmos.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_javascript&quot;&gt;JavaScript&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-javascript&quot; data-lang=&quot;javascript&quot;&gt;//javascript
// Maybe type
const Maybe = (value) =&amp;gt; ({
  map: (fn) =&amp;gt; (value !== null &amp;amp;&amp;amp; value !== undefined ? Maybe(fn(value)) : Maybe(null)),
  flatMap: (fn) =&amp;gt; (value !== null &amp;amp;&amp;amp; value !== undefined ? fn(value) : Maybe(null)),
  getOrElse: (defaultValue) =&amp;gt; (value !== null &amp;amp;&amp;amp; value !== undefined ? value : defaultValue),
});

// Either type
const Either = {
  Left: (value) =&amp;gt; ({
    map: (fn) =&amp;gt; Either.Left(value),
    flatMap: (fn) =&amp;gt; Either.Left(value),
    getOrElse: (defaultValue) =&amp;gt; defaultValue,
    isLeft: true,
    isRight: false,
  }),
  Right: (value) =&amp;gt; ({
    map: (fn) =&amp;gt; Either.Right(fn(value)),
    flatMap: (fn) =&amp;gt; fn(value),
    getOrElse: (defaultValue) =&amp;gt; value,
    isLeft: false,
    isRight: true,
  }),
};

// Triple class
class Triple {
  constructor(a, b, c) {
    this.a = a;
    this.b = b;
    this.c = c;
  }

  map(fn) {
    return new Triple(fn(this.a), fn(this.b), fn(this.c));
  }

  static of(a, b, c) {
    return new Triple(a, b, c);
  }

  // Example method using Maybe and Either
  divideBy(other) {
    return Maybe(this.b)
      .flatMap((numerator) =&amp;gt;
        Maybe(other)
          .flatMap((denominator) =&amp;gt;
            denominator !== 0
              ? Either.Right(numerator / denominator)
              : Either.Left(&#39;Division by zero&#39;)
          )
      )
      .getOrElse(Either.Left(&#39;Invalid input&#39;));
  }
}

// Example usage
const triple = Triple.of(1, 2, 3);
const result = triple.map((x) =&amp;gt; x * 2);
console.log(result); // Triple { a: 2, b: 4, c: 6 }

const divisionResult = triple.divideBy(2);
console.log(divisionResult); // Either.Right { value: 1 }

const invalidDivisionResult = triple.divideBy(0);
console.log(invalidDivisionResult); // Either.Left { value: &#39;Division by zero&#39; }&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_typescript&quot;&gt;TypeScript&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-typescript&quot; data-lang=&quot;typescript&quot;&gt;//Typescript
// Maybe type
// noinspection JSAnnotator

type Maybe&amp;lt;T&amp;gt; = {
  map&amp;lt;U&amp;gt;(fn: (value: T) =&amp;gt; U): Maybe&amp;lt;U&amp;gt;;
  flatMap&amp;lt;U&amp;gt;(fn: (value: T) =&amp;gt; Maybe&amp;lt;U&amp;gt;): Maybe&amp;lt;U&amp;gt;;
  getOrElse(defaultValue: T): T;
};

const just = &amp;lt;T&amp;gt;(value: T): Maybe&amp;lt;T&amp;gt; =&amp;gt; ({
  map: &amp;lt;U&amp;gt;(fn: (value: T) =&amp;gt; U) =&amp;gt; just(fn(value)),
  flatMap: &amp;lt;U&amp;gt;(fn: (value: T) =&amp;gt; Maybe&amp;lt;U&amp;gt;) =&amp;gt; fn(value),
  getOrElse: (_: T) =&amp;gt; value,
});

const nothing = &amp;lt;T&amp;gt;(): Maybe&amp;lt;T&amp;gt; =&amp;gt; ({
  map: &amp;lt;U&amp;gt;(_: (value: T) =&amp;gt; U) =&amp;gt; nothing&amp;lt;U&amp;gt;(),
  flatMap: &amp;lt;U&amp;gt;(_: (value: T) =&amp;gt; Maybe&amp;lt;U&amp;gt;) =&amp;gt; nothing&amp;lt;U&amp;gt;(),
  getOrElse: (defaultValue: T) =&amp;gt; defaultValue,
});

// Either type
type Either&amp;lt;L, R&amp;gt; = {
  map&amp;lt;U&amp;gt;(fn: (value: R) =&amp;gt; U): Either&amp;lt;L, U&amp;gt;;
  flatMap&amp;lt;U&amp;gt;(fn: (value: R) =&amp;gt; Either&amp;lt;L, U&amp;gt;): Either&amp;lt;L, U&amp;gt;;
  getOrElse(defaultValue: R): R;
  isLeft: boolean;
  isRight: boolean;
};

const left = &amp;lt;L, R&amp;gt;(value: L): Either&amp;lt;L, R&amp;gt; =&amp;gt; ({
  map: &amp;lt;U&amp;gt;(_: (value: R) =&amp;gt; U) =&amp;gt; left&amp;lt;L, U&amp;gt;(value),
  flatMap: &amp;lt;U&amp;gt;(_: (value: R) =&amp;gt; Either&amp;lt;L, U&amp;gt;) =&amp;gt; left&amp;lt;L, U&amp;gt;(value),
  getOrElse: (defaultValue: R) =&amp;gt; defaultValue,
  isLeft: true,
  isRight: false,
});

const right = &amp;lt;L, R&amp;gt;(value: R): Either&amp;lt;L, R&amp;gt; =&amp;gt; ({
  map: &amp;lt;U&amp;gt;(fn: (value: R) =&amp;gt; U) =&amp;gt; right&amp;lt;L, U&amp;gt;(fn(value)),
  flatMap: &amp;lt;U&amp;gt;(fn: (value: R) =&amp;gt; Either&amp;lt;L, U&amp;gt;) =&amp;gt; fn(value),
  getOrElse: (_: R) =&amp;gt; value,
  isLeft: false,
  isRight: true,
});

// Triple class
class Triple&amp;lt;T&amp;gt; {
  constructor(public a: T, public b: T, public c: T) {}

  map&amp;lt;U&amp;gt;(fn: (value: T) =&amp;gt; U): Triple&amp;lt;U&amp;gt; {
    return new Triple&amp;lt;U&amp;gt;(fn(this.a), fn(this.b), fn(this.c));
  }

  static of&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;(a: T, b: T, c: T): Triple&amp;lt;T&amp;gt; {
    return new Triple&amp;lt;T&amp;gt;(a, b, c);
  }

  // Example method using Maybe and Either
  divideBy(other: T): Either&amp;lt;string, number&amp;gt; {
    return just(this.b)
      .flatMap((numerator) =&amp;gt;
        just(other)
          .flatMap((denominator) =&amp;gt;
            denominator !== 0 ? right(numerator / denominator) : left(&#39;Division by zero&#39;)
          )
      )
      .getOrElse(left(&#39;Invalid input&#39;));
  }
}

// Example usage
const triple = Triple.of(1, 2, 3);
const result = triple.map((x) =&amp;gt; x * 2);
console.log(result); // Triple { a: 2, b: 4, c: 6 }

const divisionResult = triple.divideBy(2);
console.log(divisionResult); // Either.Right { value: 1 }

const invalidDivisionResult = triple.divideBy(0);
console.log(invalidDivisionResult); // Either.Left { value: &#39;Division by zero&#39; }&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_python_pydantic_pymonad&quot;&gt;Python, pydantic, pymonad&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Para criar uma implementação em Python usando`pydantic`para a validação dos tipos e`pymonad`para as mônadas :&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Instalar as dependências :&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-bash&quot; data-lang=&quot;bash&quot;&gt;pip install pydantic pymonad&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-python&quot; data-lang=&quot;python&quot;&gt;from pymonad.either import Either, Left, Right
from pydantic import BaseModel, ValidationError, validator

# Définition de la classe Triple avec Pydantic
class Triple(BaseModel):
    a: int
    b: int
    c: int

    @validator(&#39;b&#39;)
    def validate_b(cls, b, values):
        if b == 0:
            raise ValueError(&#39;Division by zero is not allowed&#39;)
        return b

    # Méthode utilisant Either pour la gestion des erreurs
    def divide_by(self, other):
        def division(numerator, denominator):
            return Right(numerator / denominator)

        def handle_error(error):
            return Left(str(error))

        return Either(lambda: division(self.b, other)).or_else(handle_error)

# Exemple d&#39;utilisation
try:
    triple = Triple(a=1, b=2, c=3)
    result = triple.divide_by(2)

    if result.is_right:
        print(f&#39;Division result: {result.value}&#39;)
    else:
        print(f&#39;Error: {result.value}&#39;)

except ValidationError as e:
    print(f&#39;Validation Error: {e}&#39;)
except Exception as e:
    print(f&#39;An unexpected error occurred: {e}&#39;)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Neste exemplo:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;pydantic`para definir a classe`Triple`com campos tipados. O método`divide_by`utiliza a mônada`Either&lt;/code&gt; de `pymonad`para lidar com os erros potenciais resultantes da divisão por zero - Validação personalizada para garantir que o valor de`b`não é igual a zero. Se for igual a zero, uma exceção é lançada, e`pymonad`captura essa exceção para retornar um resultado`Left`indicando o erro.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_sumário&quot;&gt;Sumário&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;tempo de leitura: 30 min&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#Introduction&quot;&gt;[Introduction]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#Estrutura básica no Google Apps Script&quot;&gt;[Estrutura básica no Google Apps Script]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_tipos_e_variáveis_no_google_apps_script&quot;&gt;Tipos e Variáveis no Google Apps Script&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#Constantes&quot;&gt;Variáveis e Letras no Google Apps Script&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_operações_e_operadores_no_google_apps_script&quot;&gt;Operações e Operadores no Google Apps Script&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#Var&quot;&gt;Let e Const no Google Apps Script&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#Estruturas de Controle no Google Apps Script&quot;&gt;[Estruturas de Controle no Google Apps Script]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#Laços no Google Apps Script&quot;&gt;[Laços no Google Apps Script]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#Objetos no Google Apps Script&quot;&gt;[Objetos no Google Apps Script]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_funções_no_google_apps_script&quot;&gt;Funções no Google Apps Script&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_parâmetros_e_escopos_em_google_apps_script&quot;&gt;Parâmetros e Escopos em Google Apps Script&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#Operadores de Resto e de Espalhamento em Google Apps Script&quot;&gt;[Operadores de Resto e de Espalhamento em Google Apps Script]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Atribuição por Decomposição em Google Apps Script&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#_coleções_e_programação_declarativa_no_google_apps_script&quot;&gt;Coleções e Programação Declarativa no Google Apps Script&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_introdução&quot;&gt;Introdução&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Google Apps Script (GAS) é uma plataforma de desenvolvimento de scripts associada a diversos serviços do Google, como Google Sheets, Google Docs e Google Forms. Ela permite automatizar tarefas, adicionar funcionalidades personalizadas e integrar serviços do Google.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neste memorando, vamos explorar os principais conceitos do Google Apps Script usando exemplos concretos. Abordaremos noções como variáveis, laços, funções e muito mais, adaptando-os ao contexto específico do GAS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_estrutura_básica_em_google_apps_script&quot;&gt;Estrutura básica em Google Apps Script&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Para começar, vamos examinar a estrutura básica de um script Google Apps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-javascript&quot; data-lang=&quot;javascript&quot;&gt;/**
 * Structure de base en Google Apps Script
 */
function exempleStructureGAS() {
    // Votre code ici
    Logger.log(&quot;Hello, Google Apps Script!&quot;);
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_tipos_e_variáveis_no_google_apps_script&quot;&gt;Tipos e Variáveis no Google Apps Script&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Google Apps Script utiliza JavaScript como linguagem de programação. Os tipos de dados e as variáveis funcionam de forma semelhante ao JavaScript padrão.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-javascript&quot; data-lang=&quot;javascript&quot;&gt;/**
 * Types et Variables en Google Apps Script
 */
function exempleTypesVariablesGAS() {
    // Votre code ici
    var nombre = 42;
    var texte = &quot;Bonjour, Google Apps Script!&quot;;
    Logger.log(nombre);
    Logger.log(texte);
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_operações_e_operadores_no_google_apps_script&quot;&gt;Operações e Operadores no Google Apps Script&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As operações e operadores no Google Apps Script são os mesmos que em JavaScript.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-javascript&quot; data-lang=&quot;javascript&quot;&gt;/**
 * Opérations et Opérateurs en Google Apps Script
 */
function exempleOperationsGAS() {
    // Votre code ici
    var x = 10;
    var y = 5;
    var resultat = x + y;
    Logger.log(resultat);
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_var_let_e_const_no_google_apps_script&quot;&gt;Var, Let e Const no Google Apps Script&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No GAS, os conceitos de`var`, &lt;code&gt;let&lt;/code&gt;, et `const`são usados para declarar variáveis. No entanto, é essencial compreender suas diferenças e suas implicações.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-javascript&quot; data-lang=&quot;javascript&quot;&gt;/**
 * Var, Let et Const en Google Apps Script
 */
function exempleVarLetConstGAS() {
    // Votre code ici
    // Utilisation de var
    var x = 10;
    if (true) {
        var x = 20; // La variable x est modifiée globalement
    }
    Logger.log(x);

    // Utilisation de let
    let y = 30;
    if (true) {
        let y = 40; // La variable y est limitée au bloc if
    }
    Logger.log(y);

    // Utilisation de const
    const z = 50;
    // z = 60; // Impossible de réassigner une constante
    Logger.log(z);
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_estruturas_de_controle_em_google_apps_script&quot;&gt;Estruturas de Controle em Google Apps Script&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As estruturas de controle tais como`if`, &lt;code&gt;else&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;while&lt;/code&gt; et `for`são utilizadas para gerenciar o fluxo de execução no Google Apps Script.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-javascript&quot; data-lang=&quot;javascript&quot;&gt;/**
 * Structures de Contrôle en Google Apps Script
 */
function exempleStructuresControleGAS() {
    // Votre code ici
    var condition = true;

    if (condition) {
        Logger.log(&quot;La condition est vraie.&quot;);
    } else {
        Logger.log(&quot;La condition est fausse.&quot;);
    }

    var compteur = 0;
    while (compteur &amp;lt; 5) {
        Logger.log(compteur);
        compteur++;
    }

    for (var i = 0; i &amp;lt; 3; i++) {
        Logger.log(i);
    }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_parâmetros_e_escopos_em_google_apps_script&quot;&gt;Parâmetros e Escopos em Google Apps Script&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Os parâmetros e os escopos desempenham um papel crucial no desenvolvimento de scripts em GAS. Entenda como eles funcionam para evitar comportamentos inesperados.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-javascript&quot; data-lang=&quot;javascript&quot;&gt;/**
 * Paramètres et Scopes en Google Apps Script
 */
function exempleParametresScopesGAS(parametre) {
    // Votre code ici
    var variableGlobale = &quot;Je suis global&quot;;

    function afficherParametre() {
        Logger.log(parametre);
    }

    afficherParametre();
    Logger.log(variableGlobale);
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_constantes_variáveis_e_letras_em_google_apps_script&quot;&gt;Constantes, Variáveis e Letras em Google Apps Script&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Entender a diferença entre`const`, &lt;code&gt;var&lt;/code&gt;, et `let`é essencial para uma utilização eficaz das variáveis no Google Apps Script.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-javascript&quot; data-lang=&quot;javascript&quot;&gt;/**
 * Constantes, Variables, et Lettres en Google Apps Script
 */
function exempleConstantesVariablesLettresGAS() {
    // Votre code ici
    const constante = &quot;Je ne change pas&quot;;
    Logger.log(constante);

    var variable = &quot;Je peux changer&quot;;
    Logger.log(variable);

    let lettre = &quot;Je peux aussi changer, mais seulement dans mon bloc&quot;;
    Logger.log(lettre);
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_laços_em_google_apps_script&quot;&gt;Laços em Google Apps Script&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Laços, tais como`for` et &lt;code&gt;while&lt;/code&gt;, são essenciais para iterar sobre elementos e executar operações repetitivas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-javascript&quot; data-lang=&quot;javascript&quot;&gt;/**
 * Boucles en Google Apps Script
 */
function exempleBouclesGAS() {
    // Votre code ici
    for (var i = 0; i &amp;lt; 3; i++) {
        Logger.log(i);
    }

    var condition = true;
    var compteur = 0;

    while (condition) {
        Logger.log(&quot;Tour de boucle&quot;);
        compteur++;
        if (compteur === 3) {
            condition = false;
        }
    }
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_objetos_em_google_apps_script&quot;&gt;Objetos em Google Apps Script&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Os objetos são usados para estruturar os dados. No GAS, muitos objetos integrados facilitam a interação com os serviços do Google.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-javascript&quot; data-lang=&quot;javascript&quot;&gt;/**
 * Objets en Google Apps Script
 */
function exempleObjetsGAS() {
    // Votre code ici
    var feuille = SpreadsheetApp.getActiveSpreadsheet().getActiveSheet();
    var cellule = feuille.getRange(&quot;A1&quot;);
    cellule.setValue(&quot;Nouvelle valeur&quot;);
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_constantes_variáveis_e_letras_em_google_apps_script_2&quot;&gt;Constantes, Variáveis e Letras em Google Apps Script&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Entender a diferença entre`const`, &lt;code&gt;var&lt;/code&gt;, et `let`é essencial para uma utilização eficaz das variáveis no Google Apps Script.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-javascript&quot; data-lang=&quot;javascript&quot;&gt;/**
 * Constantes, Variables, et Lettres en Google Apps Script
 */
function exempleConstantesVariablesLettresGAS() {
    // Votre code ici
    const constante = &quot;Je ne change pas&quot;;
    Logger.log(constante);

    var variable = &quot;Je peux changer&quot;;
    Logger.log(variable);

    let lettre = &quot;Je peux aussi changer, mais seulement dans mon bloc&quot;;
    Logger.log(lettre);
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_funções_no_google_apps_script&quot;&gt;Funções no Google Apps Script&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As funções são elementos fundamentais na programação. No GAS, elas podem ser declaradas e chamadas de diferentes maneiras.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-javascript&quot; data-lang=&quot;javascript&quot;&gt;/**
 * Fonctions en Google Apps Script
 */
function exempleFonctionsGAS() {
    // Votre code ici
    function additionner(a, b) {
        return a + b;
    }

    var resultat = additionner(2, 3);
    Logger.log(resultat);

    // Fonction anonyme
    var multiplier = function (x, y) {
        return x * y;
    };

    Logger.log(multiplier(4, 5));
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_operadores_spread_e_rest_em_google_apps_script&quot;&gt;Operadores Spread e Rest em Google Apps Script&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Os operadores de descanso (&lt;code&gt;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;&lt;/code&gt;) e de propagação (&lt;code&gt;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8203;&lt;/code&gt;) são úteis para manipular os arrays e os objetos de forma concisa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-javascript&quot; data-lang=&quot;javascript&quot;&gt;/**
 * Opérateurs de Repos et de Propagation en Google Apps Script
 */
function exempleOperateursReposPropagationGAS() {
    // Votre code ici
    // Opérateur de repos (...) pour les tableaux
    var nombres = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5];
    var [...copieNombres] = nombres;
    Logger.log(copieNombres);

    // Opérateur de propagation (...) pour les objets
    var objOriginal = { x: 1, y: 2 };
    var objClone = { ...objOriginal, z: 3 };
    Logger.log(objClone);
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_atribuição_por_decomposição_em_google_apps_script&quot;&gt;Atribuição por Decomposição em Google Apps Script&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Atribuição por desestruturação é um recurso poderoso que permite extrair valores de objetos e arrays de forma concisa.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-javascript&quot; data-lang=&quot;javascript&quot;&gt;/**
 * Affectation par Décomposition en Google Apps Script
 */
function exempleAffectationDecompositionGAS() {
    // Votre code ici
    var coordonnees = [3, 4];
    var [x, y] = coordonnees;
    Logger.log(x);
    Logger.log(y);

    var utilisateur = { nom: &quot;John&quot;, age: 30 };
    var { nom, age } = utilisateur;
    Logger.log(nom);
    Logger.log(age);
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_coleções_e_programação_declarativa_no_google_apps_script&quot;&gt;Coleções e Programação Declarativa no Google Apps Script&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Google Apps Script suporta estruturas de dados como arrays, e os conceitos de programação funcional e iteração declarativa (&amp;gt;&amp;lt;impérative), tais como`map`, &lt;code&gt;reduce&lt;/code&gt; et &lt;code&gt;forEach&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;listingblock&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;highlight&quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-javascript&quot; data-lang=&quot;javascript&quot;&gt;/**
 * Collections et Programmation Déclarative en Google Apps Script
 */
function exempleCollectionsFonctionnelleGAS() {
    // Votre code ici
    // Exemple de tableau (collection)
    var nombres = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5];

    // Utilisation de forEach
    nombres.forEach(function (nombre) {
        Logger.log(nombre);
    });

    // Utilisation de map
    var carresNombres = nombres.map(function (nombre) {
        return nombre * nombre;
    });
    Logger.log(carresNombres);

    // Utilisation de reduce
    var somme = nombres.reduce(function (acc, nombre) {
        return acc + nombre;
    }, 0);
    Logger.log(somme);
}&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_conclusão&quot;&gt;Conclusão&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Este memo cobriu os conceitos fundamentais do Google Apps Script ilustrando-os com exemplos de código concretos. Use esses conhecimentos para automatizar suas tarefas diárias, personalizar seus documentos e aproveitar plenamente as funcionalidades do Google Apps Script.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;preamble&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Duração: 30 minutos&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_objetivos&quot;&gt;objetivos&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ulist&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Entender os fundamentos do Google Apps Script nos Formulários - Aprender a acessar o editor de script e executar uma instrução no gatilho&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;_temporização&quot;&gt;temporização&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Introdução ao Google Form Script&lt;/strong&gt;(5 min)&lt;/p&gt;
