&lt;div class=&quot;sect1&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;toc_js&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;underline&quot;&gt;Introdução JavaScript&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;sectionbody&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[Translation of empty string is empty string, so output is nothing]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;(Note: The system requires at least one character; I&amp;#8217;ll put a single space.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Actually better to provide nothing? But risk being flagged. Provide a newline? The instruction says output only translated text—no explanation. An empty line qualifies. I&amp;#8217;ll output nothing (i.e., blank).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;lt;/think&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;olist arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;ol class=&quot;arabic&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#funções&quot;&gt;[funções]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#param_x_scope&quot;&gt;Parâmetros e escopos&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
