&lt;div class=&quot;sect3&quot;&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&quot;_link_gist&quot;&gt;Link: &lt;a href=&quot;https://gist.github.com/cheroliv/921a13ed23ae6d4d66af8d43dd536987&quot;&gt;gist&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;

